WEBVTT

NOTE
Timed against the 26.6-second take-10 homepage preview.
The recorded narration differs slightly from the written voiceover script.
Keep captions above the app's shutter and the browser's playback controls.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.900 line:65% position:50% size:90% align:center
I love recording my son's games,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.560 line:65% position:50% size:90% align:center
but I don't love managing
tons of extra video.

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.760 line:65% position:50% size:90% align:center
Here's a typical at bat.

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.570 line:65% position:50% size:90% align:center
A few seconds after this hit,

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.940 line:65% position:50% size:90% align:center
I hit the button
to start recording.

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:15.590 line:65% position:50% size:90% align:center
I keep recording as normal

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:17.120 line:65% position:50% size:90% align:center
until the play is over.

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.200 line:65% position:50% size:90% align:center
And the video captures
up to 30 seconds

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.840 line:65% position:50% size:90% align:center
before I hit record.

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:23.390 line:65% position:50% size:90% align:center
You can also see previous videos

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.640 line:65% position:50% size:90% align:center
and change the number of seconds
to go back.
